               <note id="n1">ConceptMap.description</note>
             </notes>
        <source>Maps PHQ-9 item linkIds from the pre-2026.5.0 scheme (phq-phq9-q01…q10) to the PHQ-D block namespace (phq-phq2a…i and phq-phq9-difficulty) introduced in 2026.5.0. Apply to existing PHQ-9 QuestionnaireResponses so their item.linkId values match the current Questionnaire. The calculated items phq-phq9-score-total and phq-phq9-promis-tscore were not renamed.</source>
